{
    "background_story": "Mikaela, a skilled botanist, had always been fascinated by the healing properties of plants. Growing up in a small village surrounded by lush forests, she spent most of her childhood exploring the woods and learning about the local flora. As she grew older, Mikaela became determined to share the salubrious effects of nature with others. She established a botanical garden and wellness center, where she cultivated rare herbs and developed innovative remedies. Her garden quickly gained a reputation as a haven for those seeking solace and rejuvenation. People would travel from afar to breathe in the fresh air, walk among the soothing greenery, and benefit from Mikaela's expert knowledge of the natural world. Her dedication to promoting well-being and harmony with nature earned her the nickname 'The Green Healer'.",
